OL,6,     FThe 14 Brits who set off to climb
OL,7,     Fone of New Zealand's highest peaks
OL,8,     Fare down to 10. Having made it to
OL,9,     Fthe second base camp, they face a
OL,10,     Fvote-off presided over by host Ben
OL,11,     FShephard. As an exhausting snow
OL,12,     Fhike sees the nine remaining
OL,13,     Fclimbers tested physically and
OL,14,     Fmentally, call centre worker Sean
OL,15,     Fstruggles to keep up, a
OL,16,     Fchallenging rope crossing sees
OL,17,     Finfluencer Tara forced to find
OL,18,     Funconventional methods to stay on
